pgraded ingredients to create enhanced magical elixirs influencing the stories' outcome. Will your signature potions bring them clarity, courage, or chaos?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439220/extras/58cabd373e13fa417d925bd98c41b4f6.avif?t=1755106758\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A spellbinding experience awaits.</strong> With stunning artwork, immersive storytelling, and a touch of alchemy, this visual novel invites you to explore the modern ambitions of these iconic villains. In this world of magic and mystery, every ingredient matters.</p>",
